# DOM Boundary

`@dndgem/dom` may depend on `@dndgem/core`, browser/DOM APIs, and `@dnd-kit/dom` as an internal provider.

It must not depend on React or `@dndgem/react`.

DND-1.5 owns measurement, coordinate normalization, and ResizeObserver lifecycle in this package.

DND-1.6 owns the DnDGem interaction abstraction (`createDragInteraction`). `@dnd-kit/dom` is an implementation detail and must not leak through public types.

DND-1.7 owns Vanilla orchestration (`createLayoutSession`) and resolved-geometry application. React must wrap this session rather than reimplement solving.

Still deferred:

- leaking raw HTMLElement or dnd-kit types into Core public contracts
